  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "神祕ê『貓頭鷹』"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b>作者：邱宴藜</b><br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkn19OS2YD8myNbGoqo8OKxn5MyMFWTO7OFjWwEt97jQzjifeXheEmPuxe4K7qYOCmNn2XGTMb3KWBqm2DfZrTX0WfgrRQEM3aZkEq6rm1u2FKSbd0YOLsdyttYOnWspXGWW5KQLOBxq0y/s1600/L1510021.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1067\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"426\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkn19OS2YD8myNbGoqo8OKxn5MyMFWTO7OFjWwEt97jQzjifeXheEmPuxe4K7qYOCmNn2XGTMb3KWBqm2DfZrTX0WfgrRQEM3aZkEq6rm1u2FKSbd0YOLsdyttYOnWspXGWW5KQLOBxq0y/s640/L1510021.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n若是講著『貓頭鷹』，你ê印象是啥？是Harry Potter內底出現ê動物伴「Hedwig」、iah是tī廣告面頂掛一副目鏡、kánn-ná真巧ê尪仔？除了對『貓頭鷹』ê印象以外，你kám知影『貓頭鷹』ê台語按怎講？</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n5月21，台灣蠻野心足協會邀請李平篤老師來kā聽眾介紹『貓頭鷹』tsit款生物，tī無仝社會，『貓頭鷹』代表無仝意思，普遍來講，『貓頭鷹』因為出現tī古早ê希臘神話當中，是智慧女神ê使者（sù-tsiá），所以有「智慧」ê象徵。另外，因為『貓頭鷹』ê日本話發音「ふくろう」（Fukurou）kap「不苦労（bē辛苦）」、「福郎」倚音，致使『貓頭鷹』tī日本tsiânn做福氣ê代表，真濟建築（親像日本時代起好ê台大文學院）iah是伴手包裝，頂面lóng有『貓頭鷹』ê圖iah像。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n翻頭tńg來台灣。華語講ê『貓頭鷹』，是因為『貓頭鷹』ê面看--起-來親像貓仔面，án-ne台語--leh？『貓頭鷹』ê台語號做「鴣黃（koo-n̂g）」（編按：mā有人叫in暗光鳥、貓頭鳥），原因是tsit款生物身軀頂kuân ê色水枯黃枯黃，mā方便in bih tī樹頂歇睏。無仝語言呈現無仝看待ê角度，tse是tsiânn趣味ê代誌。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nLán人創作故事，將鴣黃當做智慧、幸福ê代表，m̄是凊彩講講，事實上，鴣黃生存tī地球有in ê本領。為著beh tī暗時活動，鴣黃ê烏仁是暗色--ê，目睭koh是管仔形--ê，hōo鴣黃ê目睭固定tī目空，bē tín動tsiah thang好掠食mi̍h，tsit-má hip相機ê跤架就是án-ne ê設計原理；另外，鴣黃ê面盤mā真特別，筋肉ē-tàng伸勼，koh有滑滑ê特化羽毛，方便收音kap助眠。老師koh展一張相片hōo gún看，hit張相片是攝影師tuì一隻鴣黃ê kha-tsiah-phiann hip--過-去，m̄-koh鴣黃ê頭suah完全轉--過-來，原來是鴣黃為著掠獵物，in ê頭演化做14塊頷頸骨，每一塊大約ē-tàng se̍h 20度。Iáu有tsiok濟趣味ê鴣黃智識，親像in ê耳空倒爿khah kuân、正爿khah低，就是beh tī聽著聲、越頭ê時tsūn，hōo身體去計算兩爿耳空ê時間差，換算做距離，án-ne ê構造後--來mā hōo人類提去參考，tsiânn做定位功能ê設計原理。是m̄是tsiok趣味--leh？</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n目前全世界鴣黃超過130種，台灣ē-tàng看著13種。其中bā-hio̍h屬--ê有12種，就是面盤親像貓仔；另外一種就是華語講ê『草鴞、猴面鷹』，面盤親像猴，tī台灣數量無濟，已經列入保育動物ê範圍。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n就親像台灣蠻野心足協會一直leh強調、tshui-sak ê代誌——用台語來講環境。Lán ê本土語言kap環境長期受著破壞，需要好好仔復育，復育ê頭一步就是ài去接觸、了解歷史、內涵，講座聽煞，對貓頭鳥、鴣黃有koh-khah濟ê了解，ē記得後擺去野外看著tsia-ê生物，用尊重ê態度欣賞--in、好好仔kā in保護。<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEilQbuvUj6ULheqPoFin8N24z7H1nGCD2pBNBqmEywBDmUBHr4YvDEKtmTaqx6UxcTPn0z5GwhFd8BtUgGJo4AYyvhOsYyhLPHWk50lqTs_npjMdxoOwbx55hsb76B1V6AgDoPaqsDMWEtQ/s1600/L1510036.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1067\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"266\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEilQbuvUj6ULheqPoFin8N24z7H1nGCD2pBNBqmEywBDmUBHr4YvDEKtmTaqx6UxcTPn0z5GwhFd8BtUgGJo4AYyvhOsYyhLPHWk50lqTs_npjMdxoOwbx55hsb76B1V6AgDoPaqsDMWEtQ/s400/L1510036.JPG\" width=\"400\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjdNbgnxVIo2BmrlS_mO-xefps3ksrd-NCzlR2_8g59RhjhIj0SZBLL_KG7xDtblDwQfa5gJ2i8kw1RhrCEqZCDzorRXHtJ7wMLQMkn71wfXwzhz0Igbqt94rw0ZpKXyarZ7-B-CBtevf2g/s1600/L1510029.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1067\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"266\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjdNbgnxVIo2BmrlS_mO-xefps3ksrd-NCzlR2_8g59RhjhIj0SZBLL_KG7xDtblDwQfa5gJ2i8kw1RhrCEqZCDzorRXHtJ7wMLQMkn71wfXwzhz0Igbqt94rw0ZpKXyarZ7-B-CBtevf2g/s400/L1510029.jpg\" width=\"400\" /></a></div>\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">編按：本文是2020/5/21棲地復育台語講座「神秘ê貓頭鷹」講座摘要記錄，講者李平篤是台灣大學生化科技學系ê名譽教授。台灣蠻野心足生態協會舉辦ê「蠻野講堂」tuì 2019年3月份起kap李江却台語文教基金會合辦規劃十場有關生態環境議題ê台語講座，歡迎逐家tī逐個月第三禮拜五暗時七點到九點，同齊來「呷米共食廚房」（台北市中正區衡陽路9號3樓）擴展家己ê台語棲地（tshe-tē）！詳細資料ē-tàng看「台灣蠻野心足生態協會」FB專頁。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">蠻野講堂&nbsp;<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/0oAEKo\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/0oAEKo</a></span></div>\n<div>\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span><br />\n<div style=\"background-color: white;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>#</b></span></span><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>棲地復育台語講座專欄，</b></span><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案</b></span><b style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\">。</b></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報316期，2020年7月出刊。</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px;\">\n--------------------------------------------</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"color: #38761d; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"color: #38761d; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span><br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span><br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div>\n</div>\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n"
